neo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=u8-P0qnr3QgQ7kNvwHT-J7j&_nc_oc=AdlWUcgZI3rKpd3LDflujhEwE7RQMFjMEIxxFCIV99pPRBiv6Dh4GouxDJ28Kf2yTV0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftP3DErNSE1j17joPzq3oRi6oJJ2xovXQ_ghrZFu_5zqA&oe=699AE6F4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QbME1T72QrYQ7kNvwEO02Qu&_nc_oc=AdmBQGTfaDIoWsHzBxhJTHThde3xbR905rg2ruYlcg6RZ2id0zbwwgrWCl_SFtwGPqU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft9VGd8PvgdTpbpVektN3UtkFz4pLeQJFhW1U36ZUMETg&oe=699AE856"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nhiZw64gnR0Q7kNvwHc2mXP&_nc_oc=AdknN_t0y-oc_nFXgQnKjYTATM5EmMj7EMQnVj3c5g05y7MF3oZ7aK9UB1yESbxbKBk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuuFZpJZFzursGhQKwEnXzTIjrb5NPKRWouKiBl1G3pLw&oe=699AFD77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974472_629709421448022_713197402145434487_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_